# Only needed when the React app is hosted on a DIFFERENT domain than the API
# (for example the app on Vercel/Netlify and the API on Render).
# Set at BUILD time; no trailing slash.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com
#
# Leave unset when one server serves both (the default setup in DEPLOY.md) or in local development.
